A+","typeTwoResourceUrl":"lgbtqia-148-playlets"},{"id":149,"name":"Suspense","typeTwoResourceUrl":"suspense-149-playlets"}],"bookList":[{"bookId":"31001667423","bookName":"A Blind Date with my Mr. Meant-to-Be","pseudonym":"DD","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-vwpv83u8jq.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":81,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Jessica, a struggling single mother who loses her daughter, Lola, to child services. ​ Years later, she unknowingly marries billionaire James Parker, Zoe's adoptive father. As secrets unravel, Jessica discovers Zoe is her long-lost daughter. Together, they overcome betrayal, threats, and heartbreak to reunite as a loving family.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":72,"totalWords":5062,"lastChapterId":62643669,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 10:46:52","lastChapterName":"072","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"A Blind Date with my Mr. Meant-to-Be","tagsList":[{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":541,"name":"Cute Kids","resourceUrl":"cute-kids-playlets-videos"},{"id":615,"name":"Little Cupids","resourceUrl":"little-cupids-playlets-videos"},{"id":527,"name":"Destiny","resourceUrl":"destiny-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-UGSjjq8TcW.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"a-blind-date-with-my-mr-meant-to-be-31001667423","viewCountDisplay":"254","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001663106","bookName":"The Wrong Bride of the Vampire Prince","pseudonym":"TXH","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-0udU9O2hoS.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":78,"ratings":0,"introduction":"The blood-infused elixir I crafted won the top honor at the Nocturne's Gala, but my adopted sister stole it and claimed the credit. She thought she'd won glory, not realizing it was a vampire betrothal contract to the Prince Kaelan—rumored to be impotent, barbaric, and monstrous. When the proposal arrived, my archmage fiancé, to \"protect\" her, hastily bound himself to her with a blood-mark and took her to his bed. She returned, the fresh mark on her neck a badge of triumph. \"Sister, your man is mine now. You turn twenty-five in three days. If no one claims you, the Matchmaking Registry will toss you to some aging, wife-beating rogue mercenary...\" She was wrong. I always had a choice. I walked to my parents, who were scrambling to clean up her mess, and declared calmly. \"If she refuses to marry Kaelan Nocturne, then I will.\"","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":39,"totalWords":2854,"lastChapterId":62673221,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 17:02:22","lastChapterName":"039","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"The Wrong Bride of the Vampire Prince","tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":552,"name":"Vampire","resourceUrl":"vampire-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-auCeX0Jnjg.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"the-wrong-bride-of-the-vampire-prince-31001663106","viewCountDisplay":"244","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001666766","bookName":"Blew Up His Gold Mine and Ran Away with His Fortune","pseudonym":"TXH","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-7rE82yqEsE.png","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":76,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Morgana, a brilliant software engineer and AI specialist from the slums, is the devoted wife of Kael Moretti—the powerful heir to a vast gold-mining empire with deep mafia ties. \nPublicly, Kael is the ultimate devoted husband who sacrificed power for love. Privately, he has maintained a long-term affair with his childhood friend Bianca Rizzo and secretly fathered twin sons with her.\nWhile pregnant after years of failed IVF, Morgana discovers the truth through photos, DNA evidence, and Bianca’s calculated provocations. Heartbroken and determined, she stages her own death by orchestrating the explosive collapse of Kael’s main gold mine, vanishes with his fortune, and starts a new life under a false identity.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":31,"totalWords":1961,"lastChapterId":62641089,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 10:15:11","lastChapterName":"031","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Blew Up His Gold Mine and Ran Away with His Fortune","tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":525,"name":"Revenge","resourceUrl":"revenge-playlets-videos"},{"id":547,"name":"Mafia","resourceUrl":"mafia-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-102QCkCZYs.png","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"blew-up-his-gold-mine-and-ran-away-with-his-fortune-31001666766","viewCountDisplay":"238","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001679208","bookName":"Hatched to Rule","pseudonym":"YW","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-nc5zT6VL3I.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":74,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Bai Yifan, a transmigrator, is reincarnated as an Iron-Clawed Chicken on Fengming Mountain and bound to the \"Strongest Rooster System.\" Upon hatching, he slays a black python to level up; later, he consumes a Fengming Red-Gold Flower and battles a profound turtle, evolving his bloodline into that of a Crimson-Flame Iridescent Chick. When the snake-demon She Zhao massacres the flock, Bai Yifan destroys the enemy using his bloodline powers and obtains a Bone Spirit Flame seed, earning the reverence of the fox-spirit Tu Shanling, who hails him as the Demon King. He seizes the Water-Cloud Cave, devours the wolf-demon Lang Mie to form his core and take human form, and enters seclusion; during this time, cultivators from the Cloud Sect mistake him for the reincarnation of the Demon Emperor. Tu Shanling risks her life to protect him, and upon emerging, he overawes the crowd with his might, thereby becoming embroiled in the conflict between humans and demons.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":82,"totalWords":7229,"lastChapterId":62423132,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-14 22:04:56","lastChapterName":"082","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":1,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Hatched to Rule","tagsList":[{"id":534,"name":"System","resourceUrl":"system-playlets-videos"},{"id":522,"name":"Secret Identity","resourceUrl":"secret-identity-playlets-videos"},{"id":558,"name":"Small Potato","resourceUrl":"small-potato-playlets-videos"},{"id":596,"name":"Patriotism","resourceUrl":"patriotism-playlets-videos"},{"id":585,"name":"Comeback","resourceUrl":"comeback-playlets-videos"},{"id":620,"name":"Reclusive Master","resourceUrl":"reclusive-master-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-HmzeOwuCuM.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"hatched-to-rule-31001679208","viewCountDisplay":"232","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001690272","bookName":"He Made Me the Joke, So I Went Home to the Mafia","pseudonym":"79","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-eVr1o8QHFk.png","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":59,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Every April Fools’ Day, Wilson Hale and Chloe Mercer turned our anniversary into a joke. A fake proposal. A trick ring. A room full of laughter. And every year, Wilson was sure I loved him too much to leave. This year, cake cream slid down my face, my ring hit the marble floor, and he still smiled like I would forgive him by morning. He forgot one thing. I was not Vivian Gray, the lonely girl with nowhere to go. I was Vivian Vescari, daughter of the most feared mafia family on the East Coast. I had left that world because I wanted to be loved before anyone knew my name. For six years, I thought Wilson was that man. Then I learned even his first confession had been an April Fools’ bet. So I stopped being the joke. I went home.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":43,"totalWords":2493,"lastChapterId":62692948,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 21:33:00","lastChapterName":"043","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"He Made Me the Joke, So I Went Home to the Mafia","tagsList":[{"id":522,"name":"Secret Identity","resourceUrl":"secret-identity-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"},{"id":547,"name":"Mafia","resourceUrl":"mafia-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-BGPorXPJuB.png","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"he-made-me-the-joke-so-i-went-home-to-the-mafia-31001690272","viewCountDisplay":"185","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001690256","bookName":"Reborn as the Dragon Lord's Bride","pseudonym":"79","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-1uHFGO2LYL.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":55,"ratings":0,"introduction":"My husband was a Gold dragon. So was I. Yet I gave birth to a small Ice Blue dragon. Then came the news: my younger half-sister had borne a Gold dragon for his younger brother. Her fame spread like wildfire. Drakon Vexis, the Crown Prince, flew into a fury. He slaughtered my child. He threw me into the frozen dungeons, where I was tortured and starved until I breathed my last. When I opened my eyes again, I had returned to the day of my coming-of-age ceremony—the day the dragon court chose its brides. Without hesitation, Drakon chose my sister. I knew then. He had been reborn too.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":41,"totalWords":2118,"lastChapterId":62692688,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 21:26:49","lastChapterName":"041","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Reborn as the Dragon Lord's Bride","tagsList":[{"id":523,"name":"Reborn","resourceUrl":"reborn-playlets-videos"},{"id":549,"name":"Dragon","resourceUrl":"dragon-playlets-videos"},{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-ib1M7Copv0.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"reborn-as-the-dragon-lord-s-bride-31001690256","viewCountDisplay":"172","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001690302","bookName":"School Bullies,Meet My 109 Big Brothers","pseudonym":"79","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-DsumTEIFLP.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":54,"ratings":0,"introduction":"\"A riot broke out in the suburbs when my mother secretly left me at the edge of it. \nMy crying caught the attention of the winning side.They walked over with their guns raised, and one of them pressed a pistol right against my forehead.Since then, I have 109 brothers in my family.At home, I'm the princess.But in high school, things were not so good.Valeria Rossi, a rich student, beat my legs with a hot curling iron that was still plugged in, burning my skin into blackened, torn flesh. The pain was so intense that I broke free from Valeria's thugs and dragged her down the stairs with me.When I wake up, Marcella Greco, dean of Students, berates me angrily.“All Valeria did is beat you up, When someone talks trash and puts their hands on you, you ought to be asking what you did wrong.How dare you plot revenge against her instead!”“Summon your guardian here right away,or forget about leaving!”All of my hair stands on end as soon as I hear the command.My guardians—109 Brothers—none of them are ordinary people, and I've been leading a normal life for more than a dozen years in order not to cause them any trouble.But if trouble shows up at my door, then I can't help it.“Are you sure you want to meet my guardians, Ms. Greco?”\"","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":35,"totalWords":1943,"lastChapterId":62692856,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 21:30:55","lastChapterName":"035","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"School Bullies,Meet My 109 Big Brothers","tagsList":[{"id":521,"name":"Family","resourceUrl":"family-playlets-videos"},{"id":609,"name":"Hate-love","resourceUrl":"hate-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"},{"id":565,"name":"Group Favorite","resourceUrl":"group-favorite-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":136,"name":"Urban","resourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-T5RDYBSYmV.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"school-bullies-meet-my-109-big-brothers-31001690302","viewCountDisplay":"169","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001690313","bookName":"Eighty-Eight Strikes and I'm Out","pseudonym":"79","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-AaUzbhSTBN.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":47,"ratings":0,"introduction":"After our eighty-eighth canceled wedding, I called my business partner. \"I'm taking the Haviana market project.\" There was a beat of stunned silence. \"Seriously? That's ten years overseas. You just got married—well, weren't you? Does your husband even know? What about your parents? You always said staying close to them was everything.\" I glanced around the empty church and let out a sharp laugh. \"There was no wedding. No husband. And my parents? They've got Cindy. That's all they need.\" Another pause. \"Alright. Pack your bags. You leave tomorrow.\" After the call, I ran a hand down my wedding dress. One last tear slipped out, quiet and pointless. Cindy had another \"episode\" today. Claimed she'd off herself. Andrew canceled—again. I'd looked at him, drained. \"It's the eighty-eighth time.\" He dropped his head, guilt all over him. \"Just a little more time, Viv. She's been off since the accident. I'm scared she'll actually do it. I swear, I'll talk to her. For real this time. Then we'll get married. Promise.\" My parents didn't hesitate. \"Vivian, let Andrew go. If Cindy hadn't gotten kidnapped trying to save you, she wouldn't have these breakdowns. Are you really putting a wedding over your sister's life?\" \"How could you be so selfish?\" I'd heard it all before. Used to fight it. Not this time. If neither my fiancé nor my parents wanted me around, then fine. I'd leave.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":45,"totalWords":2373,"lastChapterId":62692778,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 21:28:58","lastChapterName":"045","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Eighty-Eight Strikes and I'm Out","tagsList":[{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"},{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-Gmd9oaPkR5.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"eighty-eight-strikes-and-i-m-out-31001690313","viewCountDisplay":"147","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"totalPage":218,"total":2612,"popular":"POPULAR","browsePath":"\u002Fdramas\u002Fplaylets","browsePathLang":"en","typeTwoResourceUrl":"playlets","bookTypeParam":{"bookTypeOne":{"id":142,"name":"Action","typeTwoResourceUrl":"action-142-playlets"},"bookTypeTwo":{"id":136,"name":"Urban","typeTwoResourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}},"nullPage":false,"typeNewBookList":[{"bookId":"31000680019","bookName":"Goodbye, My Former Love","pseudonym":"Sue","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202401\u002Fcover-DfjlJGM1vB.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202401\u002Febdd1a106ab3c207f22849265a879cec34b6734e1dfc5a12b77ee79b5882516e5e3dbab692abf67026a7d43394b8948d.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":133447,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Ella concealed her identity and spent four years married to Ash, yet it proved insufficient to withstand the allure of a first love. Consequently, despite being seven months pregnant, Ella had to endure a harrowing Cesarean section. Leaving behind a divorce agreement, Ella reclaimed her status as the heiress of a wealthy family, driving Ash to the brink of insanity.","labels":["Love-Triangle","Divorce","Twisted"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":80,"totalWords":7998,"lastChapterId":7137643,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-14 04:57:23","lastChapterName":"80","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Goodbye, My Former Love","tagsList":[{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":594,"name":"Divorce","resourceUrl":"divorce-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":612,"name":"Misunderstanding","resourceUrl":"misunderstanding-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"goodbye-my-former-love-31000680019","labelsResourceUrl":["love-triangle-playlets-videos","divorce-playlets-videos","twisted-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"419.0K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001268989","bookName":"Chains of Heaven, Fist of Hell","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202601\u002Fcover-TzxGcKbpXf.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202601\u002F25c90a4be2aa6a4e09324e7444200aed0810a82e1cfbe8da5af15632f19edeb85af61804c14571d2bfbeb01161a1afb0.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":12311,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Five hundred years ago, the Buddha mistakenly imprisoned the true Great Sage, Sun Wukong, while the Six-Eared Macaque took his place. With Patriarch Bodhi’s help, Wukong returns as “Void,” reclaims the Golden Cudgel,exposes the imposter, and rallies allies to challenge heaven itself.Breaking free from divine chains, he vows to find his master and restore their bond.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":70,"totalWords":5117,"lastChapterId":16516690,"lastChapterTime":"2026-01-21 16:09:20","lastChapterName":"070","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":1,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Chains of Heaven, Fist of Hell","supportHorizontal":1,"tagsList":[{"id":525,"name":"Revenge","resourceUrl":"revenge-playlets-videos"},{"id":529,"name":"Oriental Fantasy","resourceUrl":"oriental-fantasy-playlets-videos"},{"id":585,"name":"Comeback","resourceUrl":"comeback-playlets-videos"},{"id":567,"name":"God of War","resourceUrl":"god-of-war-playlets-videos"},{"id":733,"name":"Anime","resourceUrl":"anime-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"chains-of-heaven-fist-of-hell-31001268989","viewCountDisplay":"38.6K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001216412","bookName":"Chip of Revenge: She Reprogrammed Him","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002Fcover-O6uQu526oO.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002F7a8a497345962b802c7768c24a55c5ff0b6e378245f2c6753152d6824e124094f4b54fb58711285d6ddfd6d70de95424.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":39013,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Tech genius Jolie Shannon sacrificed her career for her husband Mark Gates, only to be betrayed by his affair — even forced to serve his pregnant mistress. She filed for divorce, reclaimed her pre-marital assets and core patents, causing Mark's company's IPO to fail and driving it to the brink of bankruptcy. Throughout the divorce, she calmly handled insults from his family and gathered evidence step by step. After divorcing, she swiftly married her longtime rival from her youth, Simon Fox. With his support, she returned to the tech industry and staged a dramatic comeback in both career and love, ultimately leaving her ex-husband isolated and disgraced.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":89,"totalWords":7424,"lastChapterId":15713883,"lastChapterTime":"2025-12-03 07:51:56","lastChapterName":"089","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Chip of Revenge: She Reprogrammed Him","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":594,"name":"Divorce","resourceUrl":"divorce-playlets-videos"},{"id":597,"name":"Dynamic Duo","resourceUrl":"dynamic-duo-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"chip-of-revenge-she-reprogrammed-him-31001216412","viewCountDisplay":"122.5K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000934440","bookName":"Seduction at Midnight: Unmasking the Truth","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202502\u002Fcover-UrSgzmghp3.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202502\u002Ff5a9447611ecffdeceff95b499bc332aeb983c5a24c88d5f8aa58ad80eba060bb169ac611545436e46e7ee08a5e0a8ac.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":47423,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Six years ago, Shirley was betrayed by her adoptive sister, Sandra, losing her parents and having a one-night stand with a stranger, Sean. Ten months later, Sandra became Mrs. Quain, secretly eliminating Shirley. Miraculously surviving, Shirley transformed into the alluring dealer Quill Yale, infiltrating Sean's casino to seduce him and reclaim what was stolen. As her plan unfolds, she uncovers the truth about their past connection. Together, they expose Sandra's deceit and discover their own path to happiness.","labels":["One Night Stand","Baby","strong female lead","True Love"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":60,"totalWords":6472,"lastChapterId":11348010,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-14 14:56:29","lastChapterName":"060","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Seduction at Midnight: Unmasking the Truth","tagsList":[{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":541,"name":"Cute Kids","resourceUrl":"cute-kids-playlets-videos"},{"id":593,"name":"Betrayal","resourceUrl":"betrayal-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":586,"name":"One-Night Stand","resourceUrl":"one-night-stand-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"seduction-at-midnight-unmasking-the-truth-31000934440","labelsResourceUrl":["one-night-stand-playlets-videos","baby-playlets-videos","strong-female-lead-playlets-videos","true-love-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"148.9K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001215578","bookName":"My Boss Is My Past","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002Fcover-gU0cLqXYTv.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002Fc0b8c62fc4f206706c6c31f2d10375b91390d663da355d5885cdb2714d38931b81a0a37a8dba120b8e43425f129c2ac4.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":22236,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Sophie Quinn, from an ordinary family, dated Spencer Xavier, heir to a wealthy family, for nearly three years. After graduation, his mother's interference and Zoe Sanders' schemes indirectly caused her father's death. Heartbroken, Sophie quietly left with their dog.Four years later, Spencer reappears as her new boss and appoints her as his assistant. In public, he is a cold, untouchable CEO. In private, he relentlessly pressures her to explain why she disappeared. Though he claims it is revenge, he is always the first to protect her when she is in pain.When the truth is finally revealed, Spencer becomes her unwavering protector, even if it means standing up to his family.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":60,"totalWords":7549,"lastChapterId":15693568,"lastChapterTime":"2025-12-01 23:02:30","lastChapterName":"060","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"My Boss Is My Past","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":526,"name":"Second Chance","resourceUrl":"second-chance-playlets-videos"},{"id":581,"name":"Cinderella","resourceUrl":"cinderella-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"my-boss-is-my-past-31001215578","viewCountDisplay":"69.8K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001283369","bookName":"[ENG DUB] While They Awakened Powers, I Ascended","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202602\u002Fcover-YP1grHcKkG.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202602\u002F8930630f5338c0a1d9b1ce766415948188eb70b7fa832484b2db3c625eafc17b2b8d0f25a8abcb0daece8de67ea27935.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":12418,"ratings":0,"introduction":"To fulfill a vow to his fallen mentor, transmigrated martial artist Hugo Norris endures three years of humiliation as Yulia Sutton's simp.Once his system awakens, granting him supreme power, he publicly reveals the truth, rejects his former tormentor, and shocks all with his might. Taking up his mentor's legacy, he begins a legendary rise, facing clan conflicts with his newfound strength.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":48,"totalWords":4633,"lastChapterId":16759221,"lastChapterTime":"2026-02-03 21:55:38","lastChapterName":"048","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":1,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"[ENG DUB] While They Awakened Powers, I Ascended","supportHorizontal":1,"tagsList":[{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":567,"name":"God of War","resourceUrl":"god-of-war-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":733,"name":"Anime","resourceUrl":"anime-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"eng-dub-while-they-awakened-powers-i-ascended-31001283369","viewCountDisplay":"38.9K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"typeRecommendBookList":[{"bookId":"31001478489","bookName":"MIT After Heartbreak 2","pseudonym":"YY","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202607\u002Fcover-V791CO3VRb.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202607\u002F55d2d5f724539355d5e35d00210b9da0b12c78492da249022defb9b8d928241f5d7ee8232a6c6ef0b729a05a7aacd66f.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":4252,"ratings":0,"introduction":"The night before high school graduation, Ethan Luciano pulled me into his bedroom. His hands were rough, his touch demanding, yet my heart overflowed with a decade's worth of unspoken longing. I'd loved Ethan for ten years, and finally, it seemed my silent wishes had come true. Afterwards, as we lay tangled in his sheets, he whispered that he'd marry me after graduation. Once he took over the Luciano family's empire from his father, he'd make me the most cherished woman in the family. I believed him. The next morning, I sat curled up against his bare chest as he casually told my foster brother, Lucas, about us. My cheeks were flushed, and my heart raced, still clinging to the sweetness of the night before. However, then their conversation shifted into Italian. Lucas smirked, leaning back against the doorframe. \"Not bad, Young Boss. Your first time, and the school's 'it girl' just threw herself at you. So, how's my little sister taste?\" Ethan gave a lazy chuckle. \"Looks like an angel, but a freak in the sheets. Who would’ve thought?\" The room erupted in low, conspiratorial laughter. Lucas raised a brow. \"So, should I call her my little sister or my future sister-in-law?\" Ethan’s tone darkened, his arm tightening around my waist for a moment. Then he let out a sigh. \"She’s nothing. Just practice,\" he said, his voice dropping to a whisper. \"I’m trying to hook up with the cheer captain, Sylvia Dawson, but I don’t want her thinking I’m clueless in bed. Cynthia Saville’s just a warm-up.\" He paused. \"But don’t tell Sylvia. I don’t need her getting all emotional.\" They didn't know that I’d spent months secretly learning Italian, preparing for the life I thought I’d share with Ethan. I didn't say a word. Later that day, I quietly withdrew my early decision application to Caltech and applied to MIT instead.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":34,"totalWords":2721,"lastChapterId":50124583,"lastChapterTime":"2026-06-19 11:55:29","lastChapterName":"034","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"MIT After Heartbreak 2","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":547,"name":"Mafia","resourceUrl":"mafia-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"mit-after-heartbreak-2-31001478489","viewCountDisplay":"13.3K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001338236","bookName":"Becoming Her Own Goddess","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202603\u002Fcover-LgscexeS3J.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202603\u002F362371f1bc8f43a401ab17871505e8608777188ce3e0ea690089d7ce9dcd4a2b13f05ccd5b859df5e8f49c3cb4aecb17.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":6017,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Yuyu was once bullied in school for being overweight. Through relentless effort, she becomes a top beauty director, earning praise from her clients and enjoying a thriving career. Then one day, her first love, Joo A-in, reappears in her life. But… could it really be her?","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":51,"totalWords":6415,"lastChapterId":17685559,"lastChapterTime":"2026-03-30 11:57:36","lastChapterName":"051","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Urban"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Becoming Her Own Goddess","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":519,"name":"Entertainment","resourceUrl":"entertainment-playlets-videos"},{"id":527,"name":"Destiny","resourceUrl":"destiny-playlets-videos"},{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":136,"name":"Urban","resourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"becoming-her-own-goddess-31001338236","viewCountDisplay":"18.8K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000912484","bookName":"When a Mountain Girl Meets Mr. CEO","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202501\u002Fcover-rL6l6dRbwT.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202501\u002F0b24ebe5b23a4b360b1b8fd833d5762a955d837e90d9a92df8880082ef22f7fda0dc34b2e51112039e2e40ee626afe72.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":49910,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Orphaned Emily grew up under the care of her master, only to find out one day that he was actually the legendary Mystic Healer. When Arthur Wood, her master, discovers that the son of an old friend, Victor Shaw, is critically ill, he sends Emily down the mountain with an unusual mission: to marry Victor and save his life.\nAfter their wedding, Emily confidently vows to be the breadwinner, support her husband, and build a life for them both. Together, they hilariously take on Victor's scheming cousin and his ex-fiancée, with plenty of laughs along the way. Emily not only cures Victor's illness but also turns a tidy profit, building a thriving life for them.\nThrough their time together, they experience warmth, heartfelt moments, and unexpected surprises. Before they know it, Victor and Emily find themselves falling head over heels in love.","labels":["Flash Marriage","Destiny","CEO","Sweet","Uplifting Series"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":80,"totalWords":9442,"lastChapterId":11051051,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-11 18:00:19","lastChapterName":"080","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"When a Mountain Girl Meets Mr. CEO","tagsList":[{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":588,"name":"Flash-Marriage","resourceUrl":"flash-marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":600,"name":"Love After Marriage","resourceUrl":"love-after-marriage-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"when-a-mountain-girl-meets-mr-ceo-31000912484","labelsResourceUrl":["flash-marriage-playlets-videos","destiny-playlets-videos","ceo-playlets-videos","sweet-playlets-videos","uplifting-series-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"156.7K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001400159","bookName":"[ENG DUB] She Wanted His Ruin, He Wanted Her Closer","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202605\u002Fcover-i2xCwxrlvm.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202605\u002F232aad086beab25f903b4377424bd99d8012b711dd8eacf0e684ea0e358b79981332b34b731040b3e6fb2adac5ba8259.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":13058,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Vicky Bell disguises herself as an innocent secretary and infiltrates CEO Heath Kemp's company to uncover why he abandoned her elder sister and bring him down. But Heath sees through her from the start—yet keeps her close. He indulges her schemes, watches her act, and even helps her hide the truth. What follows is a tense game of mutual testing, a relentless push and pull where trust and obsession blur.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":60,"totalWords":6799,"lastChapterId":19056560,"lastChapterTime":"2026-05-22 17:05:44","lastChapterName":"060","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"[ENG DUB] She Wanted His Ruin, He Wanted Her Closer","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":581,"name":"Cinderella","resourceUrl":"cinderella-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"eng-dub-she-wanted-his-ruin-he-wanted-her-closer-31001400159","viewCountDisplay":"41.0K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001355093","bookName":"From Refugee to Riches","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202604\u002Fcover-ayebHJVqfW.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202604\u002F98fbd96a1d18495c1455512385c478a7027aeae3da1edee1a118e402e2b42e7e0404b07c624dc8d4b7357b425faabded.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":13510,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Yadiel Carney wakes up as a starving refugee in ancient times,saved only by his sister Delilah Carney, who 